H('20.d.4.F',2,"When you write to describe, you should:","use details that help the reader picture it",["write one word","copy another text","leave out the topic"],"Descriptive writing uses detail.")
H('20.d.4.F',3,"A student writes, First I mixed the paint. Then I painted the sky. This is writing to:","explain or narrate steps",["persuade the reader to buy","describe a smell","list rules"],"Sequence words show steps.")

